cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "lockkernel: locking kernel universality in synchronization transitions"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the exact parametric solution of the locking
  self consistency, the line of universality classes set by the locking kernel
  tail, the criterion for the order of the transition, and the class resolved
  dynamics used to test the time averaged kernel against the full motion.
